'''King Wahwah's Return''' (絶・チワワン伯爵降臨 ''Zetsu・Chiwawan Hakushaku Kōrin'', '''Absolute・Count Chiwawan Advent''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] and appears on the 5th, 6th, 19th and 20th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[N-1 Grand Prix (Deadly)|King Wahwah's Revenge]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first cleared, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]] - Macho Crystal Cat.

